kX2xXknLmI83kJ1/img.jpg?width=800&amp;height=444&amp;face=0_0_800_444,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/pUvY8/hyWV2ZZ4qU/Sji7SJmWlPBDwXxdJkkk30/img.jpg?width=640&amp;height=355&amp;face=0_0_640_355\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Bothriolepis - Wikipedia</p><p class=\"og-desc\">Holotype: B. ornata Eichwald, 1840 B. africana Long et al., 1997 B. alexi Young, 1988 B. alvesiensis Stensio, 1948 B. amankonyrica Malinovskaja, 1988 B. antarctica Woodward, 1921 B. askinae Young, 1988 B. babichevi Malinovskaja, 1992 B. barretti Young, 198</p><p class=\"og-host\">en.wikipedia.org</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/38e2675406d041f85d9281698502dc66603b099f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/38e2675406d041f85d9281698502dc66603b099f\" data-origin-width=\"1764\" data-origin-height=\"954\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9018eda3f447c1f7f1215454b07ed70f8e837ef3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9018eda3f447c1f7f1215454b07ed70f8e837ef3\" data-origin-width=\"1382\" data-origin-height=\"746\"><div class=\"figcaption\">삽엽충( &#160;trilobite) - 고생대( 캄브리아기~페름기)</div></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b1a4fa9bc048a29c3353f84c9663dfb4407939b1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b1a4fa9bc048a29c3353f84c9663dfb4407939b1\" data-origin-width=\"800\" data-origin-height=\"431\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a4c2dc19cb52cc3006c8075372a1e8642a9073e8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a4c2dc19cb52cc3006c8075372a1e8642a9073e8\" data-origin-width=\"1200\" data-origin-height=\"750\"><div class=\"figcaption\">딥노린쿠스( Dipnorhynchus , 고생대 ( 데본기) )</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/05618ecff65dbdd4d636a78999bd9597f4b3df3b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/05618ecff65dbdd4d636a78999bd9597f4b3df3b\" data-origin-width=\"1387\" data-origin-height=\"750\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5bf88b82b14d71563f0457915e4a9950d1bb7394\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5bf88b82b14d71563f0457915e4a9950d1bb7394\" data-origin-width=\"1378\" data-origin-height=\"742\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3fffc553950f66050332af3c68f21e99301133e5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3fffc553950f66050332af3c68f21e99301133e5\" data-origin-width=\"600\" data-origin-height=\"325\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8bb000ade004d2a023763d7c7df80d651322d317\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8bb000ade004d2a023763d7c7df80d651322d317\" data-origin-width=\"2048\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/401523c0f45f0a3ac712fc51df4de5c50e22e3af\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/401523c0f45f0a3ac712fc51df4de5c50e22e3af\" data-origin-width=\"315\" data-origin-height=\"174\"></div><p><b>애니메이션의 주인공 포뇨는 &quot;아기 물고기&quot;</b> 이고,</p><p><b>&quot;고생대- 데본기는 어류의 시대&quot;</b>라고 불릴 정도로 다양한 어류들이 번성했다고 합니다.</p><p>애니메이션 작가도 과학을 잘해야겠습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><b>Age of Fishes( </b><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devonian\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\"><b>Devonian - Wikipedia</b></a><b>)</b></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
